{"articleNo":"2712","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2712&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010 겨울계절수업 성적처리 일정안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.01.12","hit":"12856","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"465\" bgcolor=\"#9bf4f4\" height=\"48\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -40.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #03389b; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 양재 소슬,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: #03389b; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양견명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">2010학년도 겨울계절수업 성적처리 일정</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1. 성적입력기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011. 1. 17(월) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000cd; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">00:01 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">~ 1. 19(수) 23:59</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2. 성적처리내역</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 성적처리학기 : 2010학년도 2학기 성적으로 처리</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 재수강교과목일 경우 기 취득성적은 삭제됨</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp;- 계절수업성적&nbsp;장학선발 및 해당학기의 성적순위산출에는 산입되지 않음</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. 성적확인 및 정정기간</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 가. 성적확인 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000cd; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011. 1. 20(목) 09:00 ~ 1. 21(금) 18:00</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 원스톱서비스 로그인 ⇒ 수업 ⇒ 계절수업 성적내역 조회 클릭</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 95pt; TEXT-INDENT: -95pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">학적부사진미제출자는 열람할 수 없으니 반드시 학사서비스센터[학생회관1층(478-7066)]에 사진제출 후 열람하시기 바랍니다&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 나. 성적정정 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000cd; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011. 1. 20(목) 09:00 ~ 1. 21(금) 18:00</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 담당교수에게 직접 방문, 전화, 이메일을 통한 정정 신청</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 담당교수와 연결이 되지 않을 경우 해당 학부(과) 사무실 방문 혹은 전화로 문의</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 정정신청 후에는 성적정정이 되었는지를 정정기간 내에 반드시 확인하여야 함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 다. 문의전화</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"102\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"25\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">행정실 명</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"321\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" cols